{"type":"text","timestamp":1784778448727,"sessionID":"ses_072eb300fffe8p5YmPbKiVSwl9","part":{"id":"prt_f8d15cae5001KWYtHDz24qdJgj","messageID":"msg_f8d15b2cc001GxaCa2iwF8Moxj","sessionID":"ses_072eb300fffe8p5YmPbKiVSwl9","type":"text","text":"查询完成！结果如下：\n\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 男性住院患者 (SEX='M', Admission='+') | 89 |\n| 男性门诊患者 (SEX='M', Admission='-') | 107 |\n| 百分比 (住院/门诊) | 83.18% |\n\n**结论：outpatient（门诊）男性患者更多。** 门诊男性患者比住院男性患者多 18 人。住院男性患者数量是门诊男性患者的 83.18%。\n\n---\n\nFinal Answer: There are more outpatient males (107) than in-patient males (89). The percentage (in-patient/outpatient) is 83.18%.\nEvidence SQL: SELECT SUM(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '+' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS male_inpatient, SUM(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '-' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS male_outpatient, CAST(SUM(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '+' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS FLOAT) / NULLIF(SUM(CASE WHEN SEX = 'M' AND Admission = '-' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END), 0) * 100 AS percentage FROM Patient","time":{"start":1784778443493,"end":1784778448718}}}
